        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana GBx32D, Stainless Steel Grab Bars</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in five lengths from 18 - 42 inches these stainless steel grab bars are have a 1-1/2 Inch diameter. They come with a brushed stainless steel finish. These are most often used in the bathrooms near the tub and toilet but they are perfect for anywhere ADA compliant grab bars are required. The 42 inch model is available with or with out the center support post.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor dimensional specifications see: <a href=\"/products/42-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb42u32d\"><b>Deltana GB42U32D</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/36-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb36u32d\"><b>Deltana GB36U32D</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb30u32d\"><b>Deltana GB30U32D</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/24-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb24u32d\"><b>Deltana GB24U32D</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/18-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-grab-bar-deltana-gb18u32d\"><b>Deltana GB18U32D</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/42-inch-stainless-steel-ada-compliant-3-post-grab-bar-deltana-gb42cpu32d\"><b>Deltana GB42CPU32D</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Stainless Steel Grab Bars:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>US32D Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Tube Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
